where \eqn{V_u} is \code{MM.res$Vu} and \eqn{w_i} is the corresponding
element of \code{MM.res$weights}.

For a single-kernel model fitted by \code{EMM.cpp},

\deqn{
\sigma_1^2 = V_u.
